cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived release."
type: software
title: "blood-methylation-comorbidity: analysis code, run logs and figure source data for a benchmarked comparison of blood DNA methylation across five common disorders"
abstract: "R scripts, run logs and figure source data of a study that compares genome-wide case-control effects of peripheral-blood DNA methylation between Parkinson's disease, schizophrenia, Alzheimer's disease, major depressive disorder and inflammatory bowel disease in ten public cohorts, with within-disease replication, permutation nulls and detection limits for every comparison."
authors:
